      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">
        World models are the foundation for autonomous agents that need to <strong>understand the consequences of actions before taking them</strong>. If next-state prediction alone teaches agents to act, it removes the most expensive constraint in agent training: human annotation.
      </p>

      <!-- Implications grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
