      <div class="rounded-xl border border-violet-500/20 bg-violet-500/[0.03] p-4">
        <p class="text-[11px] text-secondary mb-0">
          <strong>The paradigm shift:</strong> video generation models like Sora create content. World models like Photon-1 create <strong>understanding</strong>. The first is entertainment. The second is infrastructure for autonomous agents that need to reason about consequences before they act.
        </p>
